--   0007 -> waitlist_signups
--   0010 -> graph_edges, graph_nodes
--   0012 -> game_reports
--
-- SAFETY:
--   0006/0007/0012 are idempotent throughout (CREATE TABLE/INDEX IF NOT EXISTS,
--     ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS, constraints wrapped in DO $$ ... EXCEPTION
--     WHEN duplicate_object THEN null). Re-running them is a no-op.
--   0010 is NOT idempotent (bare CREATE TYPE / CREATE TABLE / ADD CONSTRAINT).
--     It is safe here ONLY because graph_edges, graph_nodes, graph_edge_type
--     and graph_node_kind were all confirmed absent. Do not re-run it.
--
-- `--> statement-breakpoint` is drizzle's separator and a valid SQL comment,
